Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:21.80,Header,,0,0,0,,{\b1}STATISTICALLY, WE'RE FINE{\b0}   |   LINACRE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.74,0:00:01.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Right-keep it tidy.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.40,0:00:05.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No, actually, don't.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.52,0:00:13.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I bought a velvet waistcoat from a man called Dave,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.58,0:00:16.18,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,He said, "It's nearly vintage," I said, "Nearly's brave."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.22,0:00:18.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Got a spreadsheet for my feelings, colour-coded in despair,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.90,0:00:20.66,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,And a tiny little whistle for emergencies involving stairs.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.42,0:00:23.92,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I'm remarkably composed in a queue for a kebab,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.96,0:00:26.42,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Till a pigeon stole my napkin and I called it a cab.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.46,0:00:28.90,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I've got manners like a butler, taste buds like a bin,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.94,0:00:31.56,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Put a crown upon a sausage and I'll probably let it in.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.60,0:00:32.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Hold up-
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.34,0:00:33.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.36,0:00:34.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No, leave it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.12,0:00:35.98,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's definitely part of the plan.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.02,0:00:38.74,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're doing fine, we're doing fine,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.78,0:00:41.22,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Absolutely normal, every single time.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.48,0:00:43.60,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Hands up high if your life's off-line,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.64,0:00:46.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're doing fine, we're doing fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.86,0:00:47.90,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Say, "Fine!"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.90,0:00:48.82,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,(Fine!)
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.46,0:00:50.48,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Say, "Fine!"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.48,0:00:50.78,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,(Fine!)
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.58,0:00:54.83,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit-statistically, we're fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.20,0:00:59.02,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I rehearsed an apology in case I bump a chair,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.06,0:01:01.50,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Then I blamed the architecture with a confident stare.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.04,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,My neighbour owns a parrot that has learned to swear,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.08,0:01:07.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now it's more emotionally available than anyone upstairs.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.10,0:01:09.80,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I made a five-year plan, it lasted till Tuesday,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:12.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Bought a motivational mug, it said, "Try again someday."
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.62,0:01:14.92,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,My barber asked for guidance; I said, "Surprise me, mate,"
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.96,0:01:17.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now I look like a haunted pear that's running late.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.02,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,The bass drops out-
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.02,0:01:20.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,The room gets tense-
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.40,0:01:21.19,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I've got one thought
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.24,0:01:22.76,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,And it's making no sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.80,0:01:24.60,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I'm fluent in excuses, conversational in cheek,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.16,0:01:26.62,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I can turn a minor setback to a documentary critique.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.78,0:01:30.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Got a sandwich in my pocket and a theory in my shoe,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.34,0:01:32.82,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,If confidence was currency, I'd owe a pound or two.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.86,0:01:34.56,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,You can call me unrealistic; I prefer "future-famous,"
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.46,0:01:38.02,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I put "enigmatic" on a form that asked for "name and address."
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.06,0:01:40.50,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,When the punchline lands sideways, let the brass section shout,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.54,0:01:42.32,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you didn't get the first one, there's another one-watch out.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.66,0:01:46.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're doing fine, we're doing fine,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.50,0:01:48.92,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Absolutely normal, every single time.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.20,0:01:51.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Hands up high if your life's off-line,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.38,0:01:53.80,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're doing fine, we're doing fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.26,0:01:55.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Say, "Fine!"
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.52,0:01:56.50,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,(Fine!)
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.50,0:01:57.80,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Say, "Fine!"
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.80,0:01:58.98,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,(Fine!)
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.98,0:02:03.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit-statistically, we're fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.80,0:02:05.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No further questions.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.90,0:02:09.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Please form an orderly panic.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.24,0:02:13.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're doing fine.
